 energetic community, Mrvr Tag delivers endless replayability. Will you outsmart your friends and prove yourself as the ultimate player, or will you get caught slipping?\n\nGet ready to move fast, play hard, and charge like a ape.", "short_description": "Mrvr Tag is a game that you can explore and infect others!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "811564741828335", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Mrvr Tag", "keywords": ["mrvrtag", "mrvr", "tag"], "long_description": "Mrvr Tag is an adrenaline-fueled multiplayer tag experience that puts your reflexes and strategy to the test. Step into fast-paced arenas where the goal is simple\u2014don\u2019t get tagged! But in the world of Pro, nothing stays simple for long.\n\nRun, jump, climb, and dodge your way through chaotic matches where every second counts. Whether you\u2019re the hunter striking with the other players-like speed or the runner desperately trying to escape, the tension never lets up. Quick thinking and sharp movement are the keys to survival.\n\nWith smooth controls, and an energetic community, Mrvr Tag delivers endless replayability. Will you outsmart your friends and prove yourself as the ultimate player, or will you get caught slipping?\n\nGet ready to move fast, play hard, and charge like a ape.", "short_description": "Mrvr Tag is a game that you can explore and infect others!"}]}, "developer_name": "MrvrYT", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mrvrtag.base44.app/PrivacyPolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mrvr Development", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mrvrtag.base44.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_